    <bpmn:process id="W_W1334" name="W1334. Carbon Footprint Calculation, Scope 3 Value Chain Emissions &amp; Reduction Roadmap" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual ESG reporting cycle (Q1); quarterly carbon tracking refresh; or Board ESG Committee request for updated emissions data
Frequency: Annual comprehensive carbon footprint calculation; quarterly tracking of Scope 1 and 2; Scope 3 estimated annually
Volume: Scope 1: ~200 stores + 4 DCs + logistics fleet (40 owned trucks per the fleet canon, plus company cars and DC forklifts; 3PL-contracted vehicles excluded from Scope 1); Scope 2: electricity consumption across ~205 locations; Scope 3: ~800–1,000 vendors, upstream logistics, downstream customer use of sold products
Owner: Sustainability Lead
Participants: COO, VP Supply Chain, Facilities Manager, Fleet Manager, Finance Controller, Data Scientist (emissions modeling), External Carbon Verification Auditor
Source: workflow W1334 — Carbon Footprint Calculation, Scope 3 Value Chain Emissions &amp; Reduction Roadmap</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1334_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1334_Lane1" name="Sustainability Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1334_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1334_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1334_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1334_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1334_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1334_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1334_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1334_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1334_Start3" name="Annual ESG reporting cycle (Q1); quarterly carbon tracking refresh; or Board ESG…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1334_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1334_Task4" name="Scope 1 emissions calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Scope 1 emissions calculation: Sustainability Lead compiles direct emissions data: (a) fleet fuel consumption: diesel and gasoline consumption from 40 owned delivery trucks (fleet canon), company cars, and forklifts at 4 DCs — fuel purchase records from W327 fleet management, (b) refrigerant leakage: HVAC and refrigeration systems at 200 stores and 4 DCs — maintenance records per W47, (c) on-site generators: diesel consumption from backup generators at stores — fuel purchase records, (d) calculate CO2e using Philippine DOE emission factors and IPCC guidelines; data sourced from fleet management system per W327 and facility maintenance records per W47
Responsible (R): Sustainability Lead / Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 3–5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1334_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1334_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1334_Task5" name="Scope 2 emissions calculation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Scope 2 emissions calculation: Sustainability Lead compiles indirect emissions from purchased energy: (a) electricity consumption: utility bills from all ~205 locations (200 stores + 4 DCs) — total kWh by location, (b) identify electricity grid emission factor for each location (Philippine grid average vs. Mindanao grid vs. Luzon grid — different generation mixes), (c) calculate location-based Scope 2 emissions: kWh × grid emission factor, (d) calculate market-based Scope 2 emissions (if BuildRight procures renewable energy per W173 solar installations — subtract renewable generation), (e) solar generation offset: electricity generated by rooftop solar per W173 reduces Scope 2 — calculate net reduction
Responsible (R): Sustainability Lead / Facilities Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 2–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1334_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1334_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1334_Task6" name="Scope 3 emissions estimation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Scope 3 emissions estimation: Sustainability Lead calculates value chain emissions across material categories: (a) Category 1 — Purchased goods and services: estimate using spend-based method — extract category spend data from procurement module, apply DEFRA or GHG Protocol emission intensity factors by category (cement: ~0.9 tCO2e/tonne; steel: ~1.8 tCO2e/tonne; lumber: net carbon impact depending on sourcing certification), (b) Category 4 — Upstream transportation: estimate using import TEU count from W249 × average emission per TEU-km for China/Taiwan-Philippines route + domestic logistics emissions from fleet per W315, (c) Category 9 — Downstream transportation: estimate using delivery data from W315 customer delivery records, (d) Category 11 — Use of sold products: estimate emissions from energy consumed by appliances sold (aircons, refrigerators) over estimated product lifetime, (e) Category 12 — End-of-life treatment: estimate waste generated from packaging of sold products (particularly important per RA 11898 EPR Act), (f) document methodology, data sources, assumptions, and emission factors for each category
Responsible (R): Sustainability Lead / Data Scientist
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 5–10 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1334_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1334_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1334_Task7" name="Total carbon footprint compilation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Total carbon footprint compilation: Sustainability Lead compiles total carbon footprint: (a) Scope 1 + Scope 2 + Scope 3 = total emissions in tCO2e, (b) calculate intensity metrics: tCO2e per PHP million revenue, tCO2e per sqm selling area, tCO2e per employee, tCO2e per transaction, (c) compare to prior year: absolute change and intensity change, (d) benchmark against Philippine retail sector peers (if data available) and global retail sector benchmarks, (e) identify emissions hotspots: which categories, locations, or activities contribute the most to total footprint
Responsible (R): Sustainability Lead
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 2–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1334_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1334_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1334_Task8" name="Emissions reduction roadmap">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Emissions reduction roadmap: Sustainability Lead develops 3–5 year reduction roadmap: (a) Short-term (Year 1–2): LED lighting retrofit across remaining stores (estimated 15–20% electricity reduction per store), fleet route optimization per W315 (5–10% fuel reduction), packaging reduction initiatives per RA 11898, (b) Medium-term (Year 2–3): solar installation on 50 additional stores per W173 (offset 20–30% of store electricity), refrigerant management upgrade (low-GWP refrigerants), vendor engagement on product carbon footprint per W1320, (c) Long-term (Year 3–5): transition to electric delivery vehicles (pilot 5 vehicles), green building certification for new stores per W800, circular economy initiatives for construction materials, (d) calculate projected emissions reduction per initiative and cumulative roadmap impact, (e) estimate investment required and payback period for each initiative, (f) present roadmap to CEO and Board ESG Committee for approval
Responsible (R): Sustainability Lead / COO
Accountable (A): Board ESG Committee
Duration: 5–8 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1334_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1334_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1334_Task9" name="External verification &amp; reporting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: External verification &amp; reporting: (a) engage External Carbon Verification Auditor for limited assurance on Scope 1 and 2 emissions (Scope 3 may receive reasonable assurance once methodology matures), (b) include verified carbon footprint in annual sustainability report per W694, (c) report to CDP (Carbon Disclosure Project) if requested by investors or lenders, (d) update ESG dashboard per W1321 with current year emissions data
Responsible (R): Sustainability Lead / External Auditor
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–3 weeks (elapsed)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1334_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1334_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1334_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1334_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1334_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-318 (ensure controlled execution — ESG Reporting &amp; Compliance (PA-25.3).) | - operational: engaging top-20 vendors (by emissions contribution) to provide product-level carbon footprint data per W1320; operational: using IPCC defaults or regional ASEAN factors with documented assumptions; operational: following GHG Protocol Corporate Value Chain standard and documenting exclusion rationale
Owner: Sustainability Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1334_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1334_Annotation11" targetRef="W1334_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1334_Flow13" sourceRef="W1334_Start3" targetRef="W1334_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1334_Flow14" sourceRef="W1334_Task4" targetRef="W1334_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1334_Flow15" sourceRef="W1334_Task5" targetRef="W1334_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1334_Flow16" sourceRef="W1334_Task6" targetRef="W1334_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1334_Flow17" sourceRef="W1334_Task7" targetRef="W1334_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1334_Flow18" sourceRef="W1334_Task8" targetRef="W1334_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1334_Flow19" sourceRef="W1334_Task9" targetRef="W1334_End10" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1334_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1334_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1334">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1334_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1334_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1580" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
